{% comment %} "Armoured Probiotics. Smarter Delivery. Real Results." {% endcomment %}
{%- assign cdn = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0668/5848/3883/files' -%}

<section class="vb-armoured">
  <div class="vb-armoured__inner page-width">

    <div class="vb-armoured__media">
      <img
        src="{{ cdn }}/image-90549.png"
        alt="Armoured Probiotics — Smarter Delivery"
        loading="lazy"
        class="vb-armoured__img"
        width="970" height="600"
      >
      <div class="vb-armoured__img-stat">
        <span class="vb-armoured__img-stat-num">1000×</span>
        <span class="vb-armoured__img-stat-label">More Probiotics Reach Your Gut</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="vb-armoured__copy">
      <span class="vb-label-tag">Patented MEP Technology</span>
      <h2 class="vb-h2">Armoured Probiotics.<br>Smarter Delivery.<br>Real Results.</h2>
      <div class="vb-armoured__body">
        <p>Microencapsulation with <strong>Supercritical Carbon Dioxide (scCO₂)</strong> is a breakthrough way of protecting probiotics so they actually work.</p>
        <p>Think of it as wrapping <strong>each probiotic in a microscopic coat of armour</strong> — protecting it from heat, moisture, oxygen, and stomach acid — so it arrives alive exactly where it needs to be: <em>your gut</em>.</p>
        <p>Most probiotics never make it. Ours do — delivering <strong>1000× more live bacteria</strong> to your intestines than unprotected capsules.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vb-armoured__pillars">
        <div class="vb-armoured__pillar">
          <span class="vb-armoured__pillar-icon">🛡️</span>
          <span>Acid-Proof Shell</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vb-armoured__pillar">
          <span class="vb-armoured__pillar-icon">🌡️</span>
          <span>Heat Stable</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vb-armoured__pillar">
          <span class="vb-armoured__pillar-icon">💧</span>
          <span>Moisture Resistant</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vb-armoured__pillar">
          <span class="vb-armoured__pillar-icon">🎯</span>
          <span>Gut-Targeted Release</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="vb-btn vb-btn--primary vb-btn--lg">Shop Velobiotics</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.vb-armoured {
  background: #fff;
  padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  border-top: 4px solid var(--vb-green-600);
}
.vb-armoured__inner {
  max-width: 1380px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center;
}
@media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
  .vb-armoured__inner { grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; }
}
.vb-armoured__media { position: relative; }
.vb-armoured__img {
  width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 1.5rem; object-fit: cover;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
.vb-armoured__img-stat {
  position: absolute; bottom: -1rem; right: -0.75rem;
  background: var(--vb-green-600); color: #fff;
  border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.5rem; text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(77,140,68,0.35);
}
.vb-armoured__img-stat-num { display: block; font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
.vb-armoured__img-stat-label { display: block; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0.9; max-width: 12ch; line-height: 1.35; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

.vb-armoured__copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
.vb-armoured__body p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--vb-neutral-700); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
.vb-armoured__body p:last-child { margin: 0; }

.vb-armoured__pillars {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.75rem;
}
.vb-armoured__pillar {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
  background: var(--vb-green-50); border: 1.5px solid var(--vb-green-100);
  border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--vb-neutral-800);
}
.vb-armoured__pillar-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "VB Armoured Probiotics",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "vb-section-wrap",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "VB Armoured Probiotics" }]
}
{% endschema %}
